name 'ai-generated-design-preassessment-q13_2025'

question 'A local library\'s website is well-organized, but many visitors complain that the text is small and light gray, making it hard to read. What is the main reason this website is still difficult to use?'

wrong 'It includes too many book categories.'
wrong 'It loads too slowly on public computers.'
wrong 'It doesn\'t use enough animation or images.'
right 'It\'s not accessible for all users.'

allow_multiple_attempts true

